   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "man: one,",
   "texto": [
    "**Man** is an impersonal pronoun used with the third-person verb singular: **Hier darf man nicht rauchen** (you cannot smoke here). It can also have reflective pronoun: **Man muss sich anmelden** (to be registered), **Man wäscht sich** (one is washed)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "jemand, niemand, einer, keiner",
   "texto": [
    "**Jemand** = someone; **niemand** = no one; **einer / keiner** = one / none of a group. In nominee they usually carry verb in singular: **Niemand weiß es**. They change shape according to the case: **Ich sehe jemanden** (I see someone), **Ich helfe jemandem** (I help someone). For **einer/keiner**, the termination also changes: **Einer kommt**, **Ich sehe einen**."
   ]
